    "guide_text": "🚀 HOW TO GET STARTED WITH OPEN STREAM SUITE\\n----------------------------------------------------------\\n\\n1. START THE SERVER:\\n   Press 'Start Server' on the first tab. The server will\\n   run at http://localhost:8080.\\n\\n2. ADD OVERLAYS TO OBS STUDIO:\\n   Add a Browser Source with resolution\\n   1920x1080 pointing to the files in the 'overlays/' folder:\\n   - Gameplay:       http://localhost:8080/overlays/game/index.html\\n   - Just Chatting:  http://localhost:8080/overlays/chill/index.html\\n   - Alerts/Memes:   http://localhost:8080/alerts/index.html\\n\\n3. HARDWARE CONTROL (DECKS AND MACROS):\\n   The suite ships with ready-made profiles for Ajazz AKP05, Elgato Stream\\n   Deck, and OpenDeck in the 'plugins/' folder at the root.\\n   All actions can be triggered via 1-Click URLs:\\n   http://localhost:8080/api/deck/trigger?id=susto\\n   http://localhost:8080/api/deck/timer?action=start&seconds=300\\n\\n4. IS CONNECTING TWITCH REQUIRED?\\n   No. Everything works locally without an Internet connection (the memes,\\n   the themes, the timer, and the on-screen widgets).\\n   You only need Twitch if you want to read the real chat and events.\\n",
